Menu background picture: scale it once, and on RISC OS load one per session.

FsDrawTitleBmp scaled the 1920x990 title picture to the window on every
redraw of the menu; the scaled copy is now kept until the picture or the
window size changes. On RISC OS the menu also decoded a new title PNG
every 8 seconds (about a second of CPU on a Pi each time); it now keeps
the first one.
Measured on the host with riscos-mesa's renderer (callgrind, 640x480):
decoding one title PNG is about 1200M instructions; a menu redraw was
about 130M, of which 65M was the scaling now done once.

For YSCE 231e711. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-ysflight.

diff --git a/src/graphics/gl/fsopengl.cpp b/src/graphics/gl/fsopengl.cpp
index d713000..70f5bdc 100644
--- a/src/graphics/gl/fsopengl.cpp
+++ b/src/graphics/gl/fsopengl.cpp
@@ -824,13 +824,41 @@ void FsDrawTitleBmp(const YsBitmap &bmp,YSBOOL tile)
 	bmpWid=bmp.GetWidth();
 	bmpHei=bmp.GetHeight();
 
-	YsBitmap scaledBmp;
-	
 	float xScale = (float)wid/(float)bmpWid;
 	float yScale = (float)hei/(float)bmpHei;
 	float scale = (xScale>yScale ? xScale : yScale);
 
-	scaledBmp.ScaleCopy(bmpWid*scale,bmpHei*scale,bmp);
+	// The scaled copy is kept and only made again when the picture or the
+	// window size changes: scaling a 1920x990 title picture on every redraw
+	// of the menu was most of the menu's time with software OpenGL.
+	static YsBitmap scaledBmp;
+	static const YsBitmap *cachedFrom=nullptr;
+	static const unsigned char *cachedPixels=nullptr;
+	static int cachedSrcW=0,cachedSrcH=0,cachedW=0,cachedH=0;
+	static unsigned int cachedSum=0;
+	unsigned int sum=0;
+	{
+		// A cheap check of the content too: the caller reloads new
+		// pictures into the same YsBitmap.
+		const unsigned char *rgba=bmp.GetRGBABitmapPointer();
+		const long long n=(long long)bmpWid*bmpHei*4;
+		for(long long i=0; i<n; i+=n/61+1)
+		{
+			sum=sum*31+rgba[i];
+		}
+	}
+	if(cachedFrom!=&bmp || cachedPixels!=bmp.GetRGBABitmapPointer() ||
+	   cachedSrcW!=bmpWid || cachedSrcH!=bmpHei || cachedW!=wid || cachedH!=hei || cachedSum!=sum)
+	{
+		scaledBmp.ScaleCopy(bmpWid*scale,bmpHei*scale,bmp);
+		cachedFrom=&bmp;
+		cachedPixels=bmp.GetRGBABitmapPointer();
+		cachedSrcW=bmpWid;
+		cachedSrcH=bmpHei;
+		cachedW=wid;
+		cachedH=hei;
+		cachedSum=sum;
+	}
 
 
 	if(tile==YSTRUE)
